{'symbol': 'LMT', 'date': '2022-10-20 16:51:00', 'title': 'NASA ORDERS THREE MORE ORION SPACECRAFT FROM LOCKHEED MARTIN', 'text': 'SUBSTANTIAL COST REDUCTION WILL BE SEEN THROUGH UPCOMING ARTEMIS MOON MISSIONS DENVER , OCT. 20, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0LOCKHEED MARTIN (NYSE: LMT) IS NOW UNDER CONTRACT TO DELIVER THREE ORION\xa0SPACECRAFT TO NASA FOR ITS ARTEMIS VI-VIII MISSIONS, CONTINUING THE DELIVERY OF EXPLORATION VEHICLES\xa0TO THE AGENCY TO CARRY ASTRONAUTS INTO DEEP SPACE AND AROUND THE MOON SUPPORTING THE ARTEMIS PROGRAM. LOCKHEED MARTIN IS THE PRIME CONTRACTOR TO NASA FOR THE ORION PROGRAM AND HAS COMPLETED TWO ORION VEHICLES—EFT-1 WHICH FLEW IN 2014, AND ARTEMIS I,\xa0WHICH IS WEEKS AWAY FROM ITS LAUNCH TO THE MOON—AND IS ACTIVELY BUILDING VEHICLES FOR THE ARTEMIS II-V MISSIONS.'}